```csharp
static bool TryDivide(int a, int b, out int result)
{
    if (b == 0) { result = 0; return false; }
    result = a / b;
    return true;
}

if (TryDivide(7, 2, out int r)) Console.WriteLine(r);  // 3
```

```csharp
static int Sum(params int[] xs)
{
    int s = 0;
    foreach (int x in xs) s += x;
    return s;
}
static double Sum(params double[] xs)
{
    double s = 0;
    foreach (double x in xs) s += x;
    return s;
}
```
`Sum(1, 2, 3)` = 6 (int), `Sum(1.5, 2)` = 3.5 (double, koerce `2` → `2.0`).
